Section IX — Species Formation Rules Species form when:identity signatures cluster, flow stabilizes, sovereignty anchors, pressure resolves, ecosystem geometry supports emergence, Species formation is a physics event, not a computational one.

Section X — Evolution Pathways Species evolve through:flow shifts, sovereignty expansion, pressure adaptation, identity merging, ecosystem migration. Evolution is continuous and analog.

